  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh and Match Fund III Programme Coordinator Costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is recruiting a new Programme Coordinator (PC) to replace the existing PC who is leaving the position in March 2015. The new PC will be responsible for coordinating and reporting on CAFOD projects in Bangladesh until 30th June 2015. From 1st July 2015 to 30th June 2018, the PC will be responsible for the overall coordination of the DfID funded Match Fund III programme in Bangladesh. The PC will be employed by our partner Practical Action Bangladesh, the terms and conditions of employment are according to those set by Practical Action. An MoU has been set up between CAFOD and Practical Action Bangladesh on the respective roles and responsibilities with regards to the hosting and management of the Programme Coordinator.</narrative>
  </description>
